    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The success path in `ToolRuntime._execute_governed()` already extracts and propagates supervisor envelope metadata (lines 449-464):",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "code-7",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "supervisor_result_envelope_id=(\n    supervisor_result.get(\"result_id\") if supervisor_result else None\n),\nsupervisor_result_envelope_sha256=supervisor_result_sha256,\nsupervisor_result_classification=supervisor_result_classification,",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "detailed",
        "collapsible": true,
        "collapsed_by_default": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Extraction logic (lines 449-459): - `supervisor_result` from `result_model.supervisor_result_envelope` - `supervisor_result_sha256` from `result_model.supervisor_result_envelope_sha256` - `supervisor_result_classification` from `result_model.supervisor_result_classification` - Falls back to envelope dict fields if top-level attrs are None",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Span Finalization Fix",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Before**: 6 early-return paths left trace spans open (dangling spans).",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "table-11",
      "type": "table",
      "columns": [
        "Return Path",
        "Span Closed Before",
        "Span Closed After"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "Cache hit",
          "✅",
          "✅"
        ],
        [
          "Permission refused",
          "❌",
          "✅ (`status_str=\"refused\"`)"
        ],
        [
